 ti\u1ebfp th\u1ecb li\u00ean k\u1ebft do Shopee tri\u1ec3n khai, cho ph\u00e9p b\u1ea1n ki\u1ebfm ti\u1ec1n hoa h\u1ed3ng b\u1eb1ng c\u00e1ch gi\u1edbi thi\u1ec7u s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u1ebfn ng\u01b0\u1eddi mua th\u00f4ng qua link (li\u00ean k\u1ebft) ti\u1ebfp th\u1ecb. Khi c\u00f3 ng\u01b0\u1eddi nh\u1ea5n v\u00e0o link b\u1ea1n chia s\u1ebb v\u00e0 ho\u00e0n t\u1ea5t \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng, b\u1ea1n s\u1ebd nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c hoa h\u1ed3ng t\u1eeb Shopee, th\u01b0\u1eddng dao \u0111\u1ed9ng t\u1eeb 3% \u0111\u1ebfn h\u01a1n 10%, t\u00f9y theo ng\u00e0nh h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B59vdxwcbojcA6xPBMxlLtjGgif\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Shopee Affiliate l\u00e0 ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh l\u00fd t\u01b0\u1edfng cho nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi c\u00f3 k\u00eanh m\u1ea1ng x\u00e3 h\u1ed9i nh\u01b0 Facebook, TikTok, YouTube, Instagram, blogger, reviewer, KOL, ho\u1eb7c b\u1ea5t k\u1ef3 ai mu\u1ed1n ki\u1ebfm thu nh\u1eadp online t\u1ea1i nh\u00e0 m\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n v\u1ed1n hay \u00f4m h\u00e0ng. B\u1ea1n ch\u1ec9 c\u1ea7n chia s\u1ebb link ti\u1ebfp th\u1ecb s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, nh\u01b0 n\u1eb9p nh\u00f4m ch\u1eef U, v\u00e0 nh\u1eadn hoa h\u1ed3ng t\u1eeb 3% \u0111\u1ebfn h\u01a1n 10% khi c\u00f3 \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi m\u1ecdi \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng t\u1eeb sinh vi\u00ean, m\u1eb9 b\u1ec9m s\u1eefa \u0111\u1ebfn d\u00e2n v\u0103n ph\u00f2ng.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4536\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4536\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4536\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/80.png\" alt=\"Shopee Affiliate l\u00e0 g\u00ec?\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/80.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/80-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/80-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/80-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/80-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4536\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Shopee Affiliate l\u00e0 g\u00ec?<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZTRCdJRAyo5ZlHxeQ7QlPeargXc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-C2tmd0H2vozkzbxKPFclHYG9g9d\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>2. \u01afu \u0111i\u1ec3m khi ti\u1ebfp th\u1ecb li\u00ean k\u1ebft Shopee<\/strong><\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QY8PdJmLdoPUHYxP8Fxl9r49g06\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n v\u1ed1n \u2013 kh\u00f4ng \u00f4m h\u00e0ng: Chia s\u1ebb link ti\u1ebfp th\u1ecb, nh\u1eadn hoa h\u1ed3ng khi c\u00f3 \u0111\u01a1n, kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n nh\u1eadp h\u00e0ng hay giao h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MCxdduaQ4ojB3hxslhtlWvhwgqe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Ngu\u1ed3n s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111a d\u1ea1ng: H\u00e0ng tri\u1ec7u s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m thu\u1ed9c nhi\u1ec1u ng\u00e0nh h\u00e0ng nh\u01b0 n\u1ed9i th\u1ea5t, th\u1eddi trang, \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed&#8230; d\u1ec5 ch\u1ecdn theo \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BqR8d1nOroWrRRxutBglggKJgbb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Hoa h\u1ed3ng h\u1ea5p d\u1eabn: L\u00ean t\u1edbi 20%, t\u1ed1i \u0111a 70.000\u0111\/\u0111\u01a1n. Ng\u00e0nh n\u1ed9i th\u1ea5t th\u01b0\u1eddng 5\u201311%. C\u00f3 th\u01b0\u1edfng th\u00eam v\u00e0o m\u00f9a sale l\u1edbn (11.11, 12.12&#8230;).<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GzXvdsflPoprEYxXOA1lK7NngMW\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110\u0103ng k\u00fd d\u1ec5 \u2013 mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed: Ch\u1ec9 c\u1ea7n c\u00f3 k\u00eanh truy\u1ec1n th\u00f4ng (TikTok, YouTube, blog\u2026) l\u00e0 c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd, kh\u00f4ng y\u00eau c\u1ea7u kinh nghi\u1ec7m.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ESDSdlXgyoxs2ixHiJMltMd2gud\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo d\u00f5i minh b\u1ea1ch: C\u00f3 c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 xem \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng, hoa h\u1ed3ng, t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i theo th\u1eddi gian th\u1ef1c.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Om1jdl3dFoeF1rxml1GlseCmgWc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">L\u00e0m linh ho\u1ea1t, \u1edf \u0111\u00e2u c\u0169ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c: Ch\u1ec9 c\u1ea7n \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i\/m\u00e1y t\u00ednh, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi sinh vi\u00ean, d\u00e2n v\u0103n ph\u00f2ng, m\u1eb9 b\u1ec9m\u2026<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KCMkdNiDpoSe59xL5R5ljVC9gPd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Gi\u00fap ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n k\u1ef9 n\u0103ng: H\u1ecdc th\u00eam v\u1ec1 vi\u1ebft content, SEO, l\u00e0m video&#8230; m\u1edf r\u1ed9ng c\u01a1 h\u1ed9i ngh\u1ec1 nghi\u1ec7p.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OIMjduPUQoeomzx9BppltkwzgWb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-UI8bdaOz2oGxlvxiwO0lPBzgglb\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>3. L\u1ee3i \u00edch v\u00e0 r\u1ee7i ro m\u00e0 Shopee Affiliate mang l\u1ea1i?<\/strong><\/h2>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-JMG7dDhVXoZwaexxowElaXXIgPb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"sheet\">\n<table style=\"width: 99.7526%;\">\n<colgroup>\n<col width=\"125\" \/>\n<col width=\"360\" \/>\n<col width=\"360\" \/><\/colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 17.2695%;\"><strong>Ti\u00eau ch\u00ed<\/strong><\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 42.2749%;\"><strong>L\u1ee3i \u00edch<\/strong><\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 100.691%;\"><strong>R\u1ee7i ro<\/strong><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 17.2695%;\">Chi ph\u00ed ban \u0111\u1ea7u<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 42.2749%;\">Ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed, kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n nh\u1eadp h\u00e0ng, kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n kho b\u00e3i, kh\u00f4ng ph\u1ea3i x\u1eed l\u00fd \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng. Ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi mu\u1ed1n b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u ki\u1ebfm ti\u1ec1n online kh\u00f4ng r\u1ee7i ro.<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 100.691%;\">V\u00ec kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n \u0111\u1ea7u t\u01b0 t\u00e0i ch\u00ednh n\u00ean c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 khi\u1ebfn b\u1ea1n thi\u1ebfu \u0111\u1ed9ng l\u1ef1c ho\u1eb7c d\u1ec5 b\u1ecf cu\u1ed9c n\u1ebfu k\u1ebft qu\u1ea3 ch\u1eadm.<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 17.2695%;\">Th\u1eddi gian l\u00e0m vi\u1ec7c<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 42.2749%;\">Linh ho\u1ea1t 100%, c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 l\u00e0m m\u1ecdi l\u00fac, m\u1ecdi n\u01a1i \u2013 r\u1ea5t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi sinh vi\u00ean, d\u00e2n v\u0103n ph\u00f2ng ho\u1eb7c m\u1eb9 b\u1ec9m s\u1eefa.<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 100.691%;\">Kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 th\u1eddi gian bi\u1ec3u r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng d\u1ec5 khi\u1ebfn c\u00f4ng vi\u1ec7c kh\u00f4ng hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3, thu nh\u1eadp kh\u00f4ng \u1ed5n \u0111\u1ecbnh.<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 17.2695%;\">Ngu\u1ed3n h\u00e0ng<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 42.2749%;\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m phong ph\u00fa tr\u00ean Shopee (\u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed, gia d\u1ee5ng, th\u1eddi trang, v.v.), d\u1ec5 ch\u1ecdn v\u00e0 ti\u1ebfp th\u1ecb. C\u00f3 th\u1ec3 thay \u0111\u1ed5i t\u00f9y chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch, xu h\u01b0\u1edbng.<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 100.691%;\">B\u1ea1n kh\u00f4ng ki\u1ec3m so\u00e1t \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng, \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3i hay v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n \u2013 n\u1ebfu ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n l\u00e0m k\u00e9m, uy t\u00edn b\u1ea1n c\u0169ng b\u1ecb \u1ea3nh h\u01b0\u1edfng.<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 17.2695%;\">Hoa h\u1ed3ng<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 42.2749%;\">Hoa h\u1ed3ng l\u00ean \u0111\u1ebfn 14% theo danh m\u1ee5c; thanh to\u00e1n minh b\u1ea1ch theo k\u1ef3 (th\u01b0\u1eddng 1\u20132 tu\u1ea7n). C\u00f3 b\u1ea3ng th\u1ed1ng k\u00ea r\u00f5 l\u01b0\u1ee3t click, \u0111\u01a1n ph\u00e1t sinh, thu nh\u1eadp.<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 100.691%;\">Ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch hoa h\u1ed3ng thay \u0111\u1ed5i th\u01b0\u1eddng xuy\u00ean. M\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u00f3 m\u1ee9c chia s\u1ebb th\u1ea5p, ho\u1eb7c y\u00eau c\u1ea7u \u0111i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n kh\u1eaft khe \u0111\u1ec3 nh\u1eadn hoa h\u1ed3ng.<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 17.2695%;\">Kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng tham gia<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 42.2749%;\">\u0110\u0103ng k\u00fd d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng ch\u1ec9 v\u1edbi t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n Shopee v\u00e0 m\u1ed9t n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng chia s\u1ebb (Facebook, TikTok, blog, v.v.). C\u00f3 c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 t\u1ea1o link v\u00e0 h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 t\u1eeb Shopee.<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 100.691%;\">D\u1ec5 b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u nh\u01b0ng kh\u00f3 duy tr\u00ec hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 n\u1ebfu kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c n\u1ed9i dung r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng ho\u1eb7c kh\u00f4ng hi\u1ec3u th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau.<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 17.2695%;\">R\u1ee7i ro t\u00e0i ch\u00ednh<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 42.2749%;\">G\u1ea7n nh\u01b0 kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3. B\u1ea1n kh\u00f4ng ph\u1ea3i b\u1ecf v\u1ed1n, n\u00ean r\u1ee7i ro m\u1ea5t ti\u1ec1n l\u00e0 b\u1eb1ng 0.<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 100.691%;\">Tuy kh\u00f4ng m\u1ea5t ti\u1ec1n, nh\u01b0ng m\u1ea5t th\u1eddi gian n\u1ebfu l\u00e0m kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u00fang c\u00e1ch ho\u1eb7c kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 \u0111\u01a1n ph\u00e1t sinh.<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 17.2695%;\">Thu nh\u1eadp<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 42.2749%;\">C\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ki\u1ebfm t\u1eeb v\u00e0i tr\u0103m \u0111\u1ebfn v\u00e0i ch\u1ee5c tri\u1ec7u\/th\u00e1ng n\u1ebfu bi\u1ebft x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng n\u1ed9i dung ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng v\u00e0 ch\u1ecdn s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p.<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 100.691%;\">Thu nh\u1eadp kh\u00f4ng c\u1ed1 \u0111\u1ecbnh. N\u1ebfu kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng ph\u00e1t sinh ho\u1eb7c b\u1ecb t\u1eeb ch\u1ed1i hoa h\u1ed3ng, b\u1ea1n s\u1ebd kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 thu nh\u1eadp d\u00f9 \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u1ea7u t\u01b0 c\u00f4ng s\u1ee9c.<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TiendmkyFo8rRgxx1zoldJCegBg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>K\u1ebft lu\u1eadn:<\/strong> Shopee Affiliate l\u00e0 h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c ki\u1ebfm ti\u1ec1n online c\u1ef1c k\u1ef3 ti\u1ec1m n\u0103ng, \u00edt r\u1ee7i ro v\u00e0 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi m\u1edbi. Tuy nhi\u00ean, mu\u1ed1n \u0111\u1ea1t hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 cao, b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n \u0111\u1ea7u t\u01b0 c\u00f4ng s\u1ee9c v\u00e0o x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng n\u1ed9i dung v\u00e0 hi\u1ec3u r\u00f5 th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XLHrdfQ9jomifGxEQ7olFaMXg7c\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-A9QldsVMvo0NkKxiJZBl2aYig9i\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>4. C\u00e1ch \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n Shopee Affiliate.<\/strong><\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KqUQdqWKcozZvYxi96IlM5PfgWb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 1: Truy c\u1eadp trang Shopee Affiliate ch\u00ednh th\u1ee9c<\/strong><\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DgMPdSRtkoLU3Yx2rlWlXwQbgZe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Link: <a href=\"https:\/\/affiliate.shopee.vn\/\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https:\/\/affiliate.shopee.vn<\/a><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-R1xHdle1CobpiLxtiqXlqKuTgXS\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc