cord-id-SoE5dAjXco5nwMxiOwYlPDCFgFe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Shopee Affiliate cung c\u1ea5p hoa h\u1ed3ng t\u1eeb 1% \u0111\u1ebfn 20% gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng (ch\u01b0a bao g\u1ed3m ph\u00ed v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n) cho c\u00e1c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c mua qua link ti\u1ebfp th\u1ecb. T\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 c\u1ee5 th\u1ec3 ph\u1ee5 thu\u1ed9c v\u00e0o danh m\u1ee5c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m v\u00e0 ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch c\u1ee7a nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n. D\u01b0\u1edbi \u0111\u00e2y l\u00e0 t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 hoa h\u1ed3ng ph\u1ed5 bi\u1ebfn cho m\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 ng\u00e0nh h\u00e0ng li\u00ean quan \u0111\u1ebfn n\u1eb9p nh\u00f4m ch\u1eef U ho\u1eb7c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m n\u1ed9i th\u1ea5t:<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cp1OdZcTHolTc2xaOWIlIvZVg0c\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>B\u1ea2NG T\u1ef6 L\u1ec6 HOA H\u1ed2NG SHOPEE AFFILIATE \u2013 C\u1eacP NH\u1eacT TH\u00c1NG 6\/2025<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-IqFrdmNxZo9TxrxDHf6lcdP2gpb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"sheet\">\n<table style=\"width: 95.2115%;\">\n<colgroup>\n<col width=\"240\" \/>\n<col width=\"364\" \/><\/colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 50.3895%;\"><strong>Ti\u00eau ch\u00ed<\/strong><\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 146.356%;\"><strong>Th\u00f4ng tin chi ti\u1ebft<\/strong><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50.3895%; text-align: center;\">T\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 c\u01a1 b\u1ea3n<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 146.356%; text-align: center;\">1% \u2013 20% t\u00f9y s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m v\u00e0 danh m\u1ee5c<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50.3895%; text-align: center;\">Ng\u00e0nh n\u1ed9i th\u1ea5t &amp; x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 146.356%; text-align: center;\">5% \u2013 11% (l\u00ean \u0111\u1ebfn 15% d\u1ecbp sale l\u1edbn)<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50.3895%; text-align: center;\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 146.356%; text-align: center;\">1% \u2013 8%<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50.3895%; text-align: center;\">Th\u1eddi trang \u2013 M\u1ef9 ph\u1ea9m<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 146.356%; text-align: center;\">8% \u2013 15%<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50.3895%; text-align: center;\">Shopee Mall<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 146.356%; text-align: center;\">T\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 cao h\u01a1n, t\u1ed1i \u0111a 20%<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50.3895%; text-align: center;\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m gi\u00e1 th\u1ea5p (&lt;100K)<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 146.356%; text-align: center;\">3% \u2013 10%<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50.3895%; text-align: center;\">Chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch l\u1edbn (11.11, 12.12)<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 146.356%; text-align: center;\">15% \u2013 20% t\u00f9y ng\u00e0nh h\u00e0ng<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50.3895%; text-align: center;\">Th\u01b0\u1edfng th\u00eam KOL\/KOC<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 146.356%; text-align: center;\">50.000 \u2013 v\u00e0i tri\u1ec7u VN\u0110\/chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50.3895%; text-align: center;\">Gi\u1edbi h\u1ea1n hoa h\u1ed3ng\/\u0111\u01a1n<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 146.356%; text-align: center;\">T\u1ed1i \u0111a 70.000 VN\u0110<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50.3895%; text-align: center;\">Cookie theo d\u00f5i<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 146.356%; text-align: center;\">7 ng\u00e0y (app), 30 ng\u00e0y (web)<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50.3895%; text-align: center;\">H\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c thanh to\u00e1n<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 146.356%; text-align: center;\">Chuy\u1ec3n kho\u1ea3n\/ ShopeePay<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50.3895%; text-align: center;\">Y\u00eau c\u1ea7u r\u00fat ti\u1ec1n<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 146.356%; text-align: center;\">T\u1ed1i thi\u1ec3u 200.000 VN\u0110\/chu k\u1ef3<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50.3895%; text-align: center;\">Th\u1eddi gian thanh to\u00e1n<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 146.356%; text-align: center;\">T\u1eeb ng\u00e0y 16\u201330 h\u00e0ng th\u00e1ng (cho \u0111\u01a1n c\u1ee7a th\u00e1ng tr\u01b0\u1edbc)<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-KUlHdR5wHo7nCExkeJUl8S2lgjd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"divider\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GNnJdqW8poEonFxdmKylLN1Ngph\"><strong>L\u01b0u \u00fd \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t: <\/strong>Th\u00f4ng tin v\u1ec1 t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 hoa h\u1ed3ng v\u00e0 c\u00e1c kh\u00eda c\u1ea1nh c\u1ee7a ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh Shopee Affiliate \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c cung c\u1ea5p d\u1ef1a tr\u00ean d\u1eef li\u1ec7u t\u1eeb c\u00e1c ngu\u1ed3n uy t\u00edn tr\u00ean web, t\u00e0i li\u1ec7u ch\u00ednh th\u1ee9c c\u1ee7a Shopee, v\u00e0 th\u1ef1c t\u1ebf th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng t\u1ea1i Vi\u1ec7t Nam t\u00ednh \u0111\u1ebfn th\u1eddi \u0111i\u1ec3m g\u1ea7n nh\u1ea5t c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 x\u00e1c minh (th\u00e1ng 6\/2025).<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B3YadS7S9oBTvQxyxDylILGFgXc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-Co89dfUy8ouxtNxuh9ulHmjBg0U\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>6. Ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch v\u00e0 \u0111i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n c\u1ea7n l\u01b0u \u00fd tr\u00ean Shopee Affiliate<\/strong><\/h2>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4538\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4538\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4538\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/79.png\" alt=\"Ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch v\u00e0 \u0111i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n c\u1ea7n l\u01b0u \u00fd tr\u00ean Shopee Affiliate\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/79.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/79-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/79-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/79-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/79-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4538\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch v\u00e0 \u0111i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n c\u1ea7n l\u01b0u \u00fd tr\u00ean Shopee Affiliate<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XG3ldtiiOogU6hxOW8PlcC9jgKh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">C\u1eadp nh\u1eadt theo d\u1eef li\u1ec7u m\u1edbi nh\u1ea5t \u0111\u1ebfn th\u00e1ng 6\/2025:<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FKEMdGwxLoKl3UxJXrxll3Byguh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110\u1ec3 tham gia ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh Shopee Affiliate, b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n l\u00e0 c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n t\u1eeb 18 tu\u1ed5i tr\u1edf l\u00ean, c\u00f3 t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 gi\u1ea5y t\u1edd t\u00f9y th\u00e2n h\u1ee3p l\u1ec7. Ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh m\u1edf cho nhi\u1ec1u \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng nh\u01b0 KOL\/KOC, ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng, nh\u00e0 s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o n\u1ed9i dung, h\u1ecdc sinh, sinh vi\u00ean, mi\u1ec5n l\u00e0 c\u00f3 n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 chia s\u1ebb link nh\u01b0 blog, website, fanpage, YouTube, TikTok, Instagram ho\u1eb7c c\u00e1c c\u1ed9ng \u0111\u1ed3ng tr\u1ef1c tuy\u1ebfn.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QGyGdt8K1oDVmix5OLxlUpXjgbb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">M\u1ed9t \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u00ednh hoa h\u1ed3ng khi kh\u00e1ch mua h\u00e0ng qua link ti\u1ebfp th\u1ecb c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n trong th\u1eddi gian cookie c\u00f2n hi\u1ec7u l\u1ef1c: 7 ng\u00e0y \u0111\u1ed1i v\u1edbi \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng Shopee v\u00e0 30 ng\u00e0y \u0111\u1ed1i v\u1edbi tr\u00ecnh duy\u1ec7t web. Tuy nhi\u00ean, \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng ch\u1ec9 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ghi nh\u1eadn khi ho\u00e0n t\u1ea5t th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng, kh\u00f4ng b\u1ecb h\u1ee7y ho\u1eb7c ho\u00e0n tr\u1ea3.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QUFrdvLkMoGJNRxxbdSlcl5Xgad\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Shopee kh\u00f4ng cho ph\u00e9p ch\u1ea1y qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o Google Ads v\u1edbi t\u1eeb kh\u00f3a tr\u00f9ng th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u Shopee, \u0111\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi nghi\u00eam c\u1ea5m h\u00e0nh vi spam, l\u1eeba \u0111\u1ea3o ho\u1eb7c cung c\u1ea5p th\u00f4ng tin sai l\u1ec7ch v\u1ec1 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m. B\u00ean c\u1ea1nh \u0111\u00f3, b\u1ea1n kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\u00e9p sao ch\u00e9p n\u1ed9i dung hay h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh t\u1eeb Shopee Mall ho\u1eb7c t\u1eeb nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n n\u1ebfu ch\u01b0a c\u00f3 s\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed3ng \u00fd. Thay v\u00e0o \u0111\u00f3, n\u00ean s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o n\u1ed9i dung g\u1ed1c \u0111\u1ec3 t\u0103ng uy t\u00edn, thu h\u00fat ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng v\u00e0 n\u00e2ng cao t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OzzVdCop4oULhFxuL1MlabXcgCg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">T\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 hoa h\u1ed3ng t\u1ed1i \u0111a l\u00e0 70.000 VN\u0110\/\u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng, \u00e1p d\u1ee5ng v\u1edbi h\u1ea7u h\u1ebft c\u00e1c ng\u00e0nh h\u00e0ng. Vi\u1ec7c thanh to\u00e1n hoa h\u1ed3ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ecbnh k\u1ef3 gi\u1eefa ho\u1eb7c cu\u1ed1i th\u00e1ng, th\u00f4ng qua t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng ho\u1eb7c v\u00ed ShopeePay, v\u1edbi y\u00eau c\u1ea7u t\u1ed1i thi\u1ec3u \u0111\u1ec3 r\u00fat l\u00e0 200.000 VN\u0110.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-W7pSdkeQAo6aP2xcDN7lOG6kgVd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Cu\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng, Shopee c\u00f3 ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch x\u1eed l\u00fd nghi\u00eam c\u00e1c h\u00e0nh vi vi ph\u1ea1m. T\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 b\u1ecb kh\u00f3a n\u1ebfu ph\u00e1t hi\u1ec7n gian l\u1eadn \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng, spam link, chia s\u1ebb n\u1ed9i dung sai l\u1ec7ch ho\u1eb7c kh\u00f4ng tu\u00e2n th\u1ee7 c\u00e1c \u0111i\u1ec1u kho\u1ea3n \u0111\u00e3 quy \u0111\u1ecbnh. V\u00ec v\u1eady, ng\u01b0\u1eddi tham gia c\u1ea7n tu\u00e2n th\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec3 duy tr\u00ec ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng ti\u1ebfp th\u1ecb b\u1ec1n v\u1eefng v\u00e0 hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3.<\/div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-X17rdWUZVoseLAxLIbml7MdtgVd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"divider\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ClWOdAmwsopj3XxIwyElFw8GgHg\"><strong>L\u01b0u \u00fd th\u00eam \u0111\u1ec3 kh\u00f4ng m\u1ea5t hoa h\u1ed3ng<\/strong><\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-L9RHdJRXvoFDYqxgYjhl40Wggpf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Lu\u00f4n ki\u1ec3m tra link \u0111\u00e3 g\u1eafn m\u00e3 Affiliate ch\u00ednh x\u00e1c ch\u01b0a tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi chia s\u1ebb.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CDPTdMZBpoTZ2uxsAYVljg4WgSb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>\u01afu ti\u00ean <strong>s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m t\u1eeb Shopee Mall, nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n uy t\u00edn<\/strong>, c\u00f3 ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch hoa h\u1ed3ng r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NAkddhwNKoKpbcxpXj0ls3LegIc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Theo d\u00f5i hi\u1ec7u su\u1ea5t v\u00e0 hoa h\u1ed3ng tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp trong c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 Shopee Affiliate Center.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OPl1dR0CdoG4jGxzqFMlENcKgrc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PNUNdr9pMogGNJxqj91lZlNhghc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N LEMON DIGITAL<\/strong><\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li><strong>\u0110\u1ecba ch\u1ec9: <\/strong>202 Phan V\u0103n H\u00e2n, Ph\u01b0\u1eddng Gia \u0110\u1ecbnh, H\u1ed3 Ch\u00ed Minh, Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QSZfd6ecOoQ0M8xErfBlPgUggxL\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u0110i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i: <\/strong>0938785735<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BTnbdQYsRoVWZyxjRKNl8YqEgOe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Email: <\/strong><a href=\"mailto:hi@lemondigital.vn\">hi@lemondigital.vn<\/a><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JhHtdoCkvogM1RxnWw0l3JWUgCc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Website: <\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\">https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/<\/a><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BLgAdnvuYo1qw5xPhowlRuk4gvc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Facebook: <\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/lemondigital.vn\">Lemon Digital<\/a><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Shopee Affiliate l\u00e0 h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c ti\u1ebfp th\u1ecb li\u00ean k\u1ebft gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n ki\u1ebfm ti\u1ec1n online m\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n v\u1ed1n, kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n \u00f4m h\u00e0ng hay lo x\u1eed l\u00fd \u0111\u01a1n. Ch\u1ec9 c\u1ea7n chia s\u1ebb link s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m qua c\u00e1c n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng nh\u01b0 TikTok, YouTube, Facebook, blog\u2026 v\u00e0 nh\u1eadn hoa h\u1ed3ng khi c\u00f3 ng\u01b0\u1eddi mua. V\u1edbi h\u00e0ng tri\u1ec7u s\u1ea3n [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":5,"featured_media":4771,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[1,30],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-4533","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-tin-tuc","category-kien-thuc-shopee"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4533","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemon